{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29186","headline":"和崔大夫新广北楼登眺 · 许浑","name":"和崔大夫新广北楼登眺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北望高楼夏亦寒，山重水阔接长安。\n修梁暗换丹楹小，疎牖全开彩槛宽。\n风卷浮云披睥睨，露凉明月坠阑干。\n庾公恋阙怀乡处，目送归帆下远滩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29186.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29186","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}